WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:03.315 --> 00:00:04.733
Today’s 1 Minute Monday is

00:00:04.837 --> 00:00:05.726
Be BETTER!

00:00:05.992 --> 00:00:07.610
I get a lot of entrepreneurs who write in to me

00:00:07.851 --> 00:00:09.546
and they say, “Evan, I wish I had more momentum

00:00:09.553 --> 00:00:10.358
I wish I had more customers

00:00:10.548 --> 00:00:12.006
I wish I had more money coming in.

00:00:12.444 --> 00:00:13.837
That only happens

00:00:13.837 --> 00:00:16.030
when you get better at what you do.

00:00:16.557 --> 00:00:18.051
I look at my YouTube channel

00:00:18.051 --> 00:00:20.423
and, you know, we’re coming up on 2 million views

00:00:20.518 --> 00:00:22.425
I wish it was at 200 million views

00:00:22.615 --> 00:00:24.835
I can get there by being better

00:00:25.007 --> 00:00:25.977
And if you look at my channel

00:00:26.074 --> 00:00:27.656
and you look at where I was 2 years ago

00:00:27.741 --> 00:00:29.095
go look at some of the older videos

00:00:29.354 --> 00:00:30.431
the videos now

00:00:30.431 --> 00:00:33.668
are way better than they were 2 years ago

00:00:33.668 --> 00:00:35.825
and that’s why the views may be

00:00:35.985 --> 00:00:38.556
3, 5, 10, 20 as much.

00:00:39.152 --> 00:00:40.509
But I still need to get better

00:00:40.653 --> 00:00:41.414
and so do you.

00:00:41.670 --> 00:00:42.739
If you’re not getting the results

00:00:42.739 --> 00:00:44.238
that you want from your business

00:00:44.238 --> 00:00:46.527
then you need to be better.

00:00:47.017 --> 00:00:48.116
I want you to think about

00:00:48.279 --> 00:00:50.299
3 things in the customer experience

00:00:50.299 --> 00:00:51.530
from the product they’re buying

00:00:51.530 --> 00:00:52.512
to the service they’re getting

00:00:52.512 --> 00:00:54.667
to every single interaction they get with you

00:00:54.724 --> 00:00:57.073
think of 3 things that you can make better

00:00:57.073 --> 00:00:59.237
because you want every single time

00:00:59.753 --> 00:01:01.608
a customer comes and talks to you

00:01:01.817 --> 00:01:03.176
you want them leaving saying

00:01:03.466 --> 00:01:06.193
“Wow! That was amazing.”

00:01:06.695 --> 00:01:07.697
If you’re not there yet

00:01:08.084 --> 00:01:09.248
then you need to be better.

00:01:09.747 --> 00:01:10.539
Believe.

